quran[7]{c,v,t}:
  42,45,"And you will see them being exposed to it, humbling themselves out of disgrace, looking with a faint glance secretly. And the believers will say: ‘The (real) losers are those who have ruined themselves and their families on the Day of Resurrection. Look! Indeed, the wrongdoers are in everlasting punishment.’"
  42,46,And they shall have no guardians to help them against Allah. And whoever Allah leaves to stray has no way out.
  42,47,"Respond to your Lord before there comes a day from Allah, for which there shall be no revoking. On that Day, you will have no refuge, nor shall you have (any chance of) denial."
  42,48,"And if they turn away (from your warnings), We have not sent you as a keeper over them. Your responsibility is only to communicate (the truth). Indeed, when We cause human being to taste mercy from Us, he rejoices in it. And if an evil befalls them because of what their hands have sent forth, then human beings are indeed very ungrateful."
  42,49,"To Allah belongs the kingdom of the heavens and the earth. He creates whatever He wills. He bestows females upon whomever He wills, and bestows males to whomever He wills."
  42,50,"Or He couples them as males and females, making whomever He wills infertile. Indeed, He is All-Knowing, All-Powerful."
  42,51,"It is not (possible) for any human that Allah should speak to him except through revelation, or from behind a veil, or by sending a messenger who reveals by His permission whatever He pleases. Indeed, He is All-Exalted, All-Wise."
